seg-fb584cf84218 = <b>A redesigned kshana.dev.</b> The single playground page is replaced by a multi-page site: Home, Missions, Capabilities, Evidence, Developers, Editions and Docs, with Kshana Studio one click away. Every chart, map and number on it is a recorded run of this release's engine, with the scenario and a link that reopens the same run in the Studio; the site build refuses a recording made by another engine commit. The documentation pages are generated from the repository's <c1/>, and the install options from its channels. Fonts and script libraries are served from kshana.dev itself, so no page requests anything from a third-party host. Old addresses (<c2/>, <c3/>, <c4/> share links, <c5/> embed links and the rest) redirect to their new place, and an unknown address gets a { "404" } page.

