# c3: orbit-multignss.toml
seg-aa0cb8038baa = <b>Multi-constellation availability.</b> An orbit scenario can combine several constellations (a <c1/> list alongside the primary <c2/>) for multi-GNSS availability and dilution of precision — e.g. GPS plus Galileo. New <c3/> reference scenario.

# text
seg-9b9dcd5be0a7 = <b>HTML scorecard report.</b> Every run now also produces a self-contained, branded HTML scorecard — the one-line summary, the chart (embedded as an inert data-URI image), and the full JSON — written by the CLI alongside the JSON and SVG. A shareable single-file artifact for a study deliverable or annex.

