seg-7deb93b51cc7 = <b>Trade-study parameter sweeps.</b> A new <c1/> scenario kind varies one parameter (<c2/>, <c3/>, <c4/>, or <c5/>) across a linear or logarithmic range and records a chosen figure of merit at each point for both clocks, producing the "how does holdover scale with clock stability?" comparison chart a design trade needs. New <c6/> reference scenario.

