seg-ef6f3e77b476 = <b>Monte Carlo confidence bands.</b> The clock-holdover scenario can run many realizations (new optional <c1/> field): each figure of merit is then reported as a mean with a 5th–95th-percentile spread, and the chart shades the { "5" }–{ "95" }% error envelope around the median for each clock. A single run remains the default. New <c2/> reference scenario.

