seg-0f01369fc29b = Flicker (1/f) FM floor for the clock error model, synthesised as a sum of log-spaced Ornstein-Uhlenbeck processes and calibrated so the flat Allan-deviation floor sits at a configurable level. Off by default; enabled per clock via the optional <c1/> scenario field.

